   "start": 22.016,
   "dur": 5.856,
   "speechStart": 22.114,
   "speechEnd": 27.03
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "注意，偷的是会话 cookie，不是密码。",
   "spoken": "注意，偷的是会话 cookie，不是密码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 28.092,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 28.19,
   "speechEnd": 31.332
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "会话 cookie 是登录之后的凭证，拿到它，就能绕过多因素认证。",
   "spoken": "会话 cookie 是登录之后的凭证，拿到它，就能绕过多因素认证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.392,
   "dur": 5.88,
   "speechStart": 32.49,
   "speechEnd": 37.43
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "就算账号用了硬件密钥，通常也挡不住，硬件密钥只保护登录这一步。",
   "spoken": "就算账号用了硬件密钥，通常也挡不住，硬件密钥只保护登录这一步。",
